gen_2201_03220.py:106:Definition and certificate. Section 1 defines Maximum Induced Matching as
gen_2201_03220.py:107:finding a maximum vertex subset S for which every vertex of G[S] has degree
gen_2201_03220.py:108:exactly one; the size-k search form used here is its witness-producing decision
gen_2201_03220.py:109:version. The answer is S itself, not a surrogate. Verification directly counts
gen_2201_03220.py:110:degrees in the induced graph and does not consult the planted answer.
gen_2201_03220.py:111:
gen_2201_03220.py:112:Step 0. Section 1 identifies polynomial-time cases including trees, interval
gen_2201_03220.py:113:graphs, chordal graphs, and circular-arc graphs, and cites NP-hardness for
gen_2201_03220.py:114:planar 3-regular graphs. Theorem 4 gives the older O(1.3139^n) route through
gen_2201_03220.py:115:Maximum Independent Set in the line graph of the graph square. Theorem 5 and
gen_2201_03220.py:116:Section 4 give the paper's O(1.2630^n), polynomial-space bisection/branching
gen_2201_03220.py:117:algorithm. Thus a polynomial certificate-producing algorithm does not make
gen_2201_03220.py:118:the native general problem easy, and this module declares Track A rather than
gen_2201_03220.py:119:hiding a known polynomial reference method. Worst-case hardness does not prove
gen_2201_03220.py:120:this planted distribution hard; the measured adversary panel is the additional
gen_2201_03220.py:121:distributional evidence and is reported with that limitation.
gen_2201_03220.py:122:
gen_2201_03220.py:123:Inverse generation. First sample the selected class S. Pair all vertices of S,
gen_2201_03220.py:124:giving each selected vertex its unique selected neighbor. Give every selected
gen_2201_03220.py:125:vertex two random neighbors outside S, then pair the unused outside stubs. The
gen_2201_03220.py:126:configuration is accepted only when it is simple, connected, cubic, and has no
gen_2201_03220.py:127:3- or 4-cycle. Finally relabel every vertex uniformly and shuffle the edge list.
gen_2201_03220.py:128:The stored S is consequently a valid induced-matching witness by construction;
gen_2201_03220.py:129:no search over candidate witnesses occurs during generation.
gen_2201_03220.py:130:
gen_2201_03220.py:131:Attack hardening. The earlier balanced construction put one internal neighbor
gen_2201_03220.py:132:in both latent classes. A randomized minimum-conflict greedy found a target on
gen_2201_03220.py:133:every seed and that version was discarded. The shipping construction raises
gen_2201_03220.py:134:the selected fraction near the stub-capacity boundary. Girth at least five
gen_2201_03220.py:135:makes every edge conflict with exactly twelve other edges, removing the planted
gen_2201_03220.py:136:edge's simplest local signature. The panel tests radius-three outliers,
gen_2201_03220.py:137:lexicographic greedy packing, 256 randomized minimum-conflict restarts, a
gen_2201_03220.py:138:smallest-eigenvector-style spectral rounding, and the paper-licensed Cameron
gen_2201_03220.py:139:line-graph-square exact formulation with a one-million-node branch cap.
gen_2201_03220.py:140:
gen_2201_03220.py:141:Canonicalization. General cubic-graph isomorphism is not solved. The key starts
gen_2201_03220.py:142:from each vertex's complete distance histogram, performs stable color
gen_2201_03220.py:143:refinement, and hashes the resulting color/neighbor-color incidence multiset.
gen_2201_03220.py:144:It is invariant under vertex relabeling, endpoint reversal, and edge ordering,
gen_2201_03220.py:145:and distinguishes all audited seeds, but two non-isomorphic distance-regular
