Implemented a self-contained Track A generator based on the paper’s native induced-matching problem. The paper’s Theorem 5 gives the \(O(1.2630^n)\) exact algorithm used in the hardness analysis. [Full paper](https://arxiv.org/html/2201.03220v1).

